    "heritage": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "eyebrow": {
          "type": "eyebrow",
          "settings": {
            "text": "House of Sutherland"
          }
        },
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Sutherland’s distilling heritage",
            "size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Distilling in this part of the Highlands goes back to 1819, when the 1st Duke of Sutherland founded Clynelish. Dunrobin Highland Distillery carries that heritage forward from Golspie, home to Dunrobin Castle, the seat of the Dukes of Sutherland.</p><p>Our motto comes from the same house: <em>Sans Peur</em>, “without fear”.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
